#: aleph_conflicts.lua
msgid "ZenOS is also on"
msgstr "O ZenOS também está ativado"

#: aleph_conflicts.lua
msgid ""
"Aleph and ZenOS replace the same parts of KOReader: the home screen, the reader's menus, the page browser, the dictionary and the status bars. Running both can make KOReader freeze or crash, most often when a book is closed.\n"
"\n"
"To use Aleph, turn ZenOS off in Plugin management and restart KOReader."
msgstr ""
"O Aleph e o ZenOS substituem as mesmas partes do KOReader: a tela inicial, os menus do leitor, o navegador de páginas, o dicionário e as barras de status. Usar os dois pode fazer o KOReader travar ou fechar, principalmente ao fechar um livro.\n"
"\n"
"Para usar o Aleph, desative o ZenOS em Gerenciamento de plugins e reinicie o KOReader."

#: aleph_conflicts.lua
msgid "%1 is also on"
msgstr "%1 também está ativado"

#: aleph_conflicts.lua
msgid ""
"Aleph and %1 both put their own home screen over KOReader's file browser. Running both can make KOReader slow, freeze or crash, most often when a book is closed.\n"
"\n"
"To use Aleph, turn %1 off in Plugin management and restart KOReader."
